# Databse Rules

Implement Supabase backend for my Flutter invoice app. I need:

1. Set up database tables with proper relationships for users, organizations, clients, catalog items, and invoices

2. Implement Row Level Security (RLS) policies that:
   - Restrict data access to authenticated users only
   - Ensure users can only see their own data
   - Apply proper security for all database operations

3. Create Dart models that map to the database schema

4. Develop repository pattern services that:
   - Handle all CRUD operations
   - Use proper error handling
   - Leverage the authenticated user context
   - Return typed data with appropriate models

5. Create a data migration service to:
   - Move local storage data to Supabase
   - Preserve relationships between entities
   - Handle migration errors gracefully

Follow Flutter best practices with proper null safety, async handling, and error management.

Links to the documentation:
https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/overview
https://supabase.com/docs/guides/storage
